# Build context for agent/Dockerfile, which is agent/. An allowlist: only what the image needs goes
# into the upload and the image, so no secrets, tests or evaluation data can.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!formapp_agent/
!prompts/

# Never inside those folders either.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
